The playground does not expose Ollama or a remote provider. Maintainers can use
a developer-controlled Ollama server for opt-in conformance testing of the
shared Python planner.

Heading path: Modelable Playground Architecture > 13. Artifact generation

Generated artifacts are returned as an in-memory collection:

```ts
interface GeneratedFile {
  path: string;
  mediaType: string;
  content: string | Uint8Array;
  sourceRefs: string[];
}
```

The UI supports:

- Syntax-highlighted preview.
- Search.
- Copy.
- Individual download.
- Download all as ZIP.
- Trace generated sections back to source model elements.

Generators should load lazily to reduce initial startup and memory usage.

